Route25_Text_SchoolboyDudleyIntro::
	.string "Beat the six of us trainers to win a\n"
	.string "fabulous prize!\p"
	.string "Think you’ve got what it takes?$"

Route25_Text_SchoolboyDudleyDefeat::
	.string "Whoo! Good stuff.$"

Route25_Text_SchoolboyDudley::
	.string "I did my best.\n"
	.string "I have no regrets.$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_1::
	.string "DANTE: Oh, RINA, we finally found it.\n"
	.string "This is the perfect place!$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_2::
	.string "RINA: Yes, darling!\n"
	.string "This is so beautiful!$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_3::
	.string "DANTE: RINA, I wanted to ask you\n"
	.string "something...$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_4::
	.string "DANTE: Huh? What?$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_5::
	.string "RINA: Hey! It’s {PLAYER}!$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_6::
	.string "DANTE: Why, if it isn’t {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Long time no see!\p"
	.string "Well, I’m kinda busy right now,\n"
	.string "you know...$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_7::
	.string "RINA: But it’s been a while since we\n"
	.string "battled {PLAYER}.\l"
	.string "Why don’t we have a rematch?$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_8::
	.string "DANTE: But I...$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_9::
	.string "RINA: Oh, come on...\n"
	.string "Just a quick battle...$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_10::
	.string "DANTE: All right...\p"
	.string "That thing will have to wait till we\n"
	.string "defeat you!$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerMDefeat::
	.string "DANTE: Oh. Now I feel less confident…$"

@ ShinyGold fix: the hack overwrote the end of this line with the next text, so it read "...has prevaileDANTE: ...".
Route25_Text_CooltrainerMVictory::
	.string "RINA: Finally... The power of\n"
	.string "LOVE has prevailed!$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_11::
	.string "DANTE: ...$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_12::
	.string "RINA: Why do you look so down,\n"
	.string "honey?$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_13::
	.string "DANTE: Oh... Just forget it...\p"
	.string "But I know someday I will have\n"
	.string "another chance.\p"
	.string "Well, see ya soon, {PLAYER}.$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerM_14::
	.string "RINA: I wonder what’s wrong with him?$"

Route25_Text_LassEllenIntro::
	.string "I’m second.\n"
	.string "Now it’s serious!$"

Route25_Text_LassEllenDefeat::
	.string "How could I lose?$"

Route25_Text_SuperNerdPatIntro::
	.string "Mufufufu...\p"
	.string "I have nothing to do with the six-\n"
	.string "pack trainers.\p"
	.string "I waited here to beat you when you\n"
	.string "were tired out by all the battles.$"

Route25_Text_SuperNerdPatDefeat::
	.string "Aren’t you tired at all?$"

Route25_Text_SuperNerdPat::
	.string "I’m sorry... I won’t cheat anymore...$"

Route25_Text_SchoolboyJoeIntro::
	.string "Here’s No. 3!\n"
	.string "I won’t be easy.$"

Route25_Text_SchoolboyJoeDefeat::
	.string "Ow! Stomped flat!$"

Route25_Text_LassLauraIntro::
	.string "I’m No. 4!\n"
	.string "Getting tired?$"

Route25_Text_LassLauraDefeat::
	.string "I lost too...$"

Route25_Text_CamperLloydIntro::
	.string "OK! I’m No. 5.\n"
	.string "I’ll stomp you!$"

Route25_Text_CamperLloydDefeat::
	.string "Whoa! Too much.$"

Route25_Text_LassShannonIntro::
	.string "I’m the last in line, but I tell\n"
	.string "you, I’m tough!$"

Route25_Text_LassShannonDefeat::
	.string "You’re kidding.$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerKevin_1::
	.string "You took on one more battle than\n"
	.string "you expected, but you won anyway.\p"
	.string "As promised, you win a prize.$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerKevin_2::
	.string "But after seeing how you battle, I\n"
	.string "want to see how I’ll fare.\p"
	.string "How about it?\n"
	.string "Let me take you on.$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerKevinDefeat::
	.string "I’ve never had a battle this good!$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerKevinVictory::
	.string "Oh, well...$"

Route25_Text_CooltrainerKevin_3::
	.string "That was a great battle!\p"
	.string "You and your POKéMON are truly\n"
	.string "outstanding!$"

Route25_Text_Man::
	.string "Hello, are you here alone?\p"
	.string "If you’re out at CERULEAN’s cape…\n"
	.string "Well, it should be as a couple.$"

Route25_Text_Trigger2::
	.string "MISTY: Aww! Why did you have to\n"
	.string "show up and bug us now?\p"
	.string "Do you know what they call people\n"
	.string "like you?\p"
	.string "Pests! You heard me right, pest!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "...Oh? Those BADGES you have... Are\n"
	.string "they JOHTO GYM BADGES?\p"
	.string "If you have eight, you must be\n"
	.string "good.\p"
	.string "OK, then. Come to CERULEAN GYM.\p"
	.string "I’ll be happy to take you on.\p"
	.string "I’m MISTY, the GYM LEADER in\n"
	.string "CERULEAN.$"

Route25_Text_Sign::
	.string "SEA COTTAGE BILL’S HOUSE$"
